    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "036b0d4a2c68981ec30f": "Yeah, you know a few things! If you wanna' learn more you're gonna' have to talk to Georgio Bolero in Stormwind.",
        "27ab1b0780257a78e5cb": "Train me.",
        "566a76323ba3e7bfdc60": "Well well, not too bad. Maybe I CAN show you a few things...",
        "724e4951c925dd5552e7": "Not bad... for an amateur! Still, you know about as much as I do. If you wanna' learn more you're gonna' have to talk to Josef Gregorian in Undercity.",
        "a02ea5c1a6f5dbcd7a2b": "They say a stitch in time saves... what, eleven? Ah, I can't remember. Stupid saying anyway."
      },
      "name": "Grarnik Goodstitch",
      "subName": "Expert Tailor",
